{"ID":"20240220132653-pxqbwx2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132653-pxqbwx2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132653-pxqbwx2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312142349-xo7xj8h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312142213-5bhuzmb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312142350-tafh8oi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:95,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:95\u0026#125;","title":"【白虎汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312142350"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312142349-xo7xj8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142349-xo7xj8h"}},{"ID":"20240312142350-e3ecum6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142350-e3ecum6","updated":"20240312142350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百八十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142350-ne2y4jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142350-ne2y4jx","updated":"20240312142350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,脉浮,发热,无汗。其表不解者,不可与「白虎汤」。渴欲饮水,无表证者,「白虎加人参汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142350-smxeuye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142350-smxeuye","updated":"20240312142350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉浮,发热,无汗看着像是麻黄汤症，可是麻黄汤症一定要有恶寒，他没有恶寒。有表症的时候不要用白虎，确定无表症，也就是但热不寒，无汗是一个很好的指标。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人只要没有汗，就代表表没有解，要先解表。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312142350-tafh8oi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142350-tafh8oi","updated":"20240312142350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"临床上病人恶风、有汗，一看是桂枝汤症。结果病人又很燥渴，渴欲饮水，摸他的脉是浮大，我们知道他是太阳有问题，表有问题，阳明也有问题，这个时候把白虎汤跟桂枝汤和开在一起给他，一剂表里双解也可以。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312142242-5mw2qzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142242-5mw2qzf"}},{"ID":"20240312142244-oggrhiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-oggrhiq","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百九十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142244-qam3kz5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-qam3kz5","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」脉浮滑，此表有寒，里有热，「白虎汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142244-98t9s79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-98t9s79","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 真的是表有寒，里有热，这里没有很清楚。表有寒的话，病人恶寒、体重、节痛、无汗，才是真正的表有寒，如果是表寒里热的时候。我们开出去的处方是大青龙，大青龙就有石膏。这里的脉是浮滑，浮是表，滑是里面有痰，里面很热。表有寒是身体里面太热了，他感觉到外面空气冷，实际上都是热症。使用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白虎汤出现的时候，一定是纯热症，不会有寒症出现的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312142244-vf9d9ji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-vf9d9ji","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白虎汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312142244-a6cm15r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-a6cm15r","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"知母六两。石膏一斤碎。甘草二两。粳米六合。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312142244-lp72tfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-lp72tfb","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水一斗，煮米熟，汤成，去滓，温服一升。日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312142244-pebcaxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-pebcaxb","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粳米六合，不要放六碗，两钱就够了。知母四钱五钱都没有关系，石膏用一两以上。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142244-71j9g6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-71j9g6h","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用白虎汤，石膏要重用，石膏要用棉布包起来。汤倒出来，还有黏黏白白的粘稠的东西，那个不用吃了，汤喝掉就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142244-uqk3s34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-uqk3s34","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白虎汤高热的时候，壮热的时候，像脑膜炎，肺炎，只要有白虎汤症统统可以用。白虎汤症就是壮热燥渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142244-oe1uvdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142244-oe1uvdc","updated":"20240312142244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际上这个条辨我个人认为应该放到阳明篇去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142332-ijrbg55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142332-ijrbg55"}},{"ID":"20240312142333-3tsb4yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142333-3tsb4yh","updated":"20240312142333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百三十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142333-o18xdsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142333-o18xdsn","updated":"20240312142333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「三阳合病」，腹满，身重，难以转侧，口不仁而面垢，谵语，发汗则谵语甚；下之，则额上出汗，手足厥冷，遗尿；若自汗出者，「白虎汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142333-1sdoqhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142333-1sdoqhr","updated":"20240312142333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「三阳合病」太阳、少阳、阳明合病。前面介绍，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三阳合病的时候，和解少阳，用担法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果看到病人有太阳表症，又有少阳往来寒热，胸胁苦满，又有阳明症的大便不通，然后又有太阳症，这个时候你用小柴胡汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142333-n2bynoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142333-n2bynoa","updated":"20240312142333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6——2"}]},{"ID":"20240312142333-il5ir2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142333-il5ir2s","updated":"20240312142333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你不要管他大便，什么都不要管,就用小柴胡汤。小柴胡汤三阳并病的时候唯一的处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142333-4bh0u7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142333-4bh0u7z","updated":"20240312142333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“「三阳合病」，腹满，身重，难以转侧，口不仁而面垢，谵语，”当阳明有燥矢的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明有热的时候，脸上的气，光鲜亮度统统会干掉，像有灰尘在上面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果这个人精神很好，大便很好，身体没有不舒服，脸看到灰灰的，这是准备坐牢，或刚从牢里出来，或正在坐牢。这个腹满，谵语，面垢看起来，以为是燥矢，你不知道他不是，他是里面虚掉了，你再去攻他，手脚四肢冰冷，遗尿，下痢遗尿大便出来都是危险的症状。若自汗出者，白虎汤主之，自己流汗出来，代表虽然攻下了，但是病人没有伤到，津液慢慢回头，这个时候白虎汤。白虎汤救逆也可以用，肠胃津液不够用白虎汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142242-mmuep2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142242-mmuep2q"}},{"ID":"20240312142213-8o4bwq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142213-8o4bwq3","updated":"20240312142213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百六十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142213-sj5gbkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142213-sj5gbkk","updated":"20240312142213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」脉滑而厥者，里有热也，「白虎汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142213-cukveh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142213-cukveh1","updated":"20240312142213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒，滑脉速度非常流畅，我们知道里面是热。外面看起来是冷的，里面是热的。这是真热假寒，寒到极限的时候，里面是热的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热到极限的时候，寒在骨髓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。里有热的时候，用白虎汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312142213-5bhuzmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312142213-5bhuzmb","updated":"20240312142213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般白虎汤出现的时候，舌头都是干裂的，摸他的脉比较大"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。他说怕冷，你摸他手很热。小便都是比较黄。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"百分之一，是他里面是冷的，外面是热的，结果处方，也可以用白虎，叫阴极会生阳。寒极会生热。热到极限的时候也会生寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。要突破中医这个观念。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当看到里面有寒，你不断用四逆汤下去还冷，生硫磺下去还冷，白虎汤让他更冷，一剂下去热就回来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]}